Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 06:15:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sc27xx-fg: allow power-supplies, as build glue

Build glue only, so that tools/apply-overlay.sh puts the fixed binding in the
tree and the dt-validate step in CI can see it. The submission copy of this
hunk is patches/upstream/0010-*.patch.
---
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/sc27xx-fg.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/sc27xx-fg.yaml
index c1de2c802..6ec99f379 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/sc27xx-fg.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/sc27xx-fg.yaml
@@ -57,6 +57,8 @@ properties:
 
   monitored-battery: true
 
+  power-supplies: true
+
 required:
   - compatible
   - reg
-- 
2.43.0

